1
00:00:00,248 --> 00:00:01,848
(Amy:)Damn it, I got cocky.

2
00:00:05,387 --> 00:00:07,427
(Howard:)Hey, Bernie.
I'm home.... Hello.

3
00:00:07,589 --> 00:00:08,659
(Bernadette:)Hi, honey.

4
00:00:08,924 --> 00:00:10,024
(Raj:)What's going on?

5
00:00:10,926 --> 00:00:12,236
(Bernadette:)Maybe you should have a seat.

6
00:00:13,095 --> 00:00:15,005
(Howard:)Okay.

7
00:00:15,097 --> 00:00:17,167
(Howard:)I know my mom's not dead,
there'd be balloons.

8
00:00:19,234 --> 00:00:23,244
(Raj:)First off, know that
we all love you and cherish you.

9
00:00:23,405 --> 00:00:25,245
(Mike Rostenkowski:)-Well, I wouldn't--
-Daddy.

10
00:00:26,241 --> 00:00:27,781
(Mike R:)You're great.

11
00:00:29,444 --> 00:00:31,754
(Mike Massimino(on skype):)-Can I say something?
-Of course.

12
00:00:34,015 --> 00:00:35,425
(Mike M:)Hey, Fruit Loops.

13
00:00:36,718 --> 00:00:38,288
(Howard:)Massimino?
Why are you here?

14
00:00:38,453 --> 00:00:41,433
(Mike M:)I heard you were thinking about going
back up to the space station,

15
00:00:41,556 --> 00:00:43,796
(Mike M:)and as someone
who's been there with you....

16
00:00:43,959 --> 00:00:46,299
Wall, you know how astronauts
need to have the 'right stuff"?

17
00:00:46,461 --> 00:00:47,871
(Raj:)Sure.

18
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:49,910
(Mike M:)The stuff you have is wrong.

19
00:00:53,468 --> 00:00:55,918
(Howard:)You don't think
I did a good job up there?

20
00:00:56,071 --> 00:00:57,451
(Mike M:)You did a fine job.

